{"title":"2022 USAMO Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find all pairs of primes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/4/e148d95e9a2349eff0d0ccd1ec50ace5fa25269b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(p, q)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/f/a1f8131b9cef2c23369011c1cbc425f2861c026e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p-q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/5/9d5681a55a654874058d03ade8b5b02eb70ff10d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$pq-q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" /> are both perfect squares.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/6/0c6957aef3bbdc5810e3a419f00bb34746a28298.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q(p-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"65\" height=\"20\" /> is a perfect square and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is prime, we should have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/5/c8594c2feb2183cfe257d3e11a4b2f01263aac67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p - 1 = qb^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"91\" height=\"20\" /> for some positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/2/fd2f65198445d89194e9a12945a93dc5bc9006fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 = p - q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"83\" height=\"20\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/0/370cc546710796eed05bfc2196f005ee768293fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q = p - a^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"83\" height=\"20\" />, and substituting that into the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/5/c8594c2feb2183cfe257d3e11a4b2f01263aac67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p - 1 = qb^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"91\" height=\"20\" /> and solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> gives\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/c/18cc34d399f01094b25cfaa974cd9164c165ef4c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[p = \\frac{a^2b^2 - 1}{b^2 - 1} = \\frac{(ab - 1)(ab + 1)}{b^2 - 1}.\\]\" width=\"259\" height=\"39\" />\nNotice that we also have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/f/ebf449e29d04d20ef7630c901612cd229e875bc2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[p = \\frac{a^2b^2 - 1}{b^2 - 1} = a^2 + \\frac{a^2 - 1}{b^2 - 1}\\]\" width=\"216\" height=\"39\" />\nand so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/a/10ae5f1f5a8db5ddb4a8e00a121eaa1325678c82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2 - 1 | a^2 - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"102\" height=\"21\" />. We run through the cases\n</p>\n<ul><li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/d/48d02444a59b917b64e8bd0963b88712fc7fa0a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />: Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/2/6b2c8a4c75619989b925886858a9e5799a580ed5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p - q = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"73\" height=\"15\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/7/d279a313ba2a898f7dc43fdc216373e0503cb93f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(p, q) = (3, 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"107\" height=\"20\" />, which works.</li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/7/397fd7b1f33bdbf6ee27a83d1bcee42d222cb331.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = b$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />: This means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/2/a2276349ac2731ade3d32265d61234ecf21395bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p = a^2 + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"84\" height=\"20\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/7/1272dd3806e9d5606535fd9a20d87ef1edfa52b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"41\" height=\"15\" />, a contradiction.</li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/d/25d8ed1fc54739081e1cc984b300a5b1bd0a984f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a &gt; b$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />: This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/0/770bb23a67d453272f91ede2adfb4bb5a51c9b39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2 - 1 &lt; ab - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"121\" height=\"18\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/8/5c8565701aa1964590967e2ac0af8d273aad466c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2 - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"45\" height=\"15\" /> can be split up into two factors <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/9/db927f10b30c3b26197304c4e3c09261891ce8e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F_1, F_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"48\" height=\"18\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/d/19db4b3adba3b3bd580a84059cb335b26dcd4bab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F_1 | ab - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"75\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/6/5164cf4dce09d0f84df2b7dcbdaf8db3fe3cf26b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F_2 | ab + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"75\" height=\"20\" />, we get</li></ul>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/e/2ce0e351d8f804dacc61365f1ce7e2406d494261.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[p = \\frac{ab - 1}{F_1} \\cdot \\frac{ab + 1}{F_2}\\]\" width=\"151\" height=\"40\" />\nand each factor is greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, contradicting the primality of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, the only solution is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/7/d279a313ba2a898f7dc43fdc216373e0503cb93f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(p, q) = (3, 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"107\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/d/62d8426d6fa86e95d41a35d99b3ef48155c3cf87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p-q = a^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"83\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/7/aa7091ab1e544c7b847213eb28f64e61e5c74642.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$pq - q = b^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"20\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/3/3834f0cef2a1f4d8524aa5bc8e3faca298550862.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"25\" height=\"16\" /> are positive integers. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/4/1943a9ac438f1ca0d24c8ab9f2e71feef4bef8f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2 - a^2 = pq - q - (p-q) = pq -p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"280\" height=\"21\" />. So,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/2/8d27d61601d217ce30d775033cd6918516de252b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b^2 - a^2 = p(q-1) \\tag{1}\\]\" width=\"309\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/3/d534b942086dae501cbdce030206adb87567bb07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bullet$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/4/2249017892bda0490d89aa6d997b953b070b1ba1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"41\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/7/b875c9cbc7c1d897ad4aae4ced9b0fcc1a2a43f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p = b^2 - a^2 = (b-a)(b+a)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"222\" height=\"21\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/6/276f19d13344062039a7ec1907adb2f96d92dea2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b-a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"72\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/f/d5f1b14bdab0a2798b2a3366523111234271fff9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+a=p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"18\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/c/01c02a65a5eb9e5703486247b0ec8e8f921046c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=\\dfrac{p-1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"80\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/d/62d8426d6fa86e95d41a35d99b3ef48155c3cf87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p-q = a^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"83\" height=\"20\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/d/ecdacb444eba45ff03102082e886320ecd77a83f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p - 2 = \\left( \\dfrac{p-1}{2} \\right)^2 \\implies p^2 - 6p + 9 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"316\" height=\"48\" /> and we find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/c/54cfc82a82f113a7432ca68f71338c383bbcb44b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" />. Hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/b/59b4df1881f7da3b0308c1784e3fed60541c8134.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(p,q) = (3,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"107\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/3/d534b942086dae501cbdce030206adb87567bb07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bullet$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/0/ec09ebe3bd5b924139a55eb21fc60a2fd017fe35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q=4k+3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"83\" height=\"16\" />, (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/f/23fa365b4a0751d7292384305fbca7fb7329316e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k\\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" /> integer), by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/6/a06cc55b2400763dfbe58812630e75dfbaac6b40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(4k+2) = b^2 - a^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"154\" height=\"21\" />. Let's examine in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/5/375c9320878d991090991bc54db44c1923d6195e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mod 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"62\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/a/f8a23a5a7b7066c5dc1b745383bd19ec0384b91a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2 - a^2 \\equiv 2 \\pmod{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"162\" height=\"21\" />. But we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/a/0cada0a38b580baae64cfe2277049b3f2de7e3c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2 - a^2 \\equiv 0, 1 \\text{ or } 3 \\pmod{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"214\" height=\"21\" />. This is a contradiction and no solution for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/2/8a2da0293622953e6b6cf8e57fcd492b01c96dfb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q = 4k + 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/3/d534b942086dae501cbdce030206adb87567bb07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bullet$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/c/69c36fb10631ec2d346646767878aae8572da87b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q=4k+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"82\" height=\"16\" />, (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/a/6da5c768d3e309c1b5337c06bf5ad8df078c5c01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" /> integer), by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/4/c74ca6b729270f56f723228ad264846df393f3e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(4k) = b^2 - a^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"123\" height=\"21\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/4/1f460577759a9f25ee80a077aa527b1b634acedb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=m\\cdot n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"76\" height=\"14\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/2/c82372fd9984a85eaf5116efc5d278e862d2f7b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\geq n \\geq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"86\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/5/6851ca945f78b10a85c14fc57fbaf75e69f57241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m, n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"34\" height=\"11\" /> are integers. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/0/f40a674e717c69679dcfba255e218168e9a12f5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p&gt;q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />, we see <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/4/bb45803ac9d798bee90fb6d6f30e53e9712a5fb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p&gt;4k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"18\" />. Thus, by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/1/a61179b18ac09c124e127ed85b75934ba1d8bb9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(b-a)(b+a) = 4p\\cdot m \\cdot n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"205\" height=\"20\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/c/02c60c151331e235dc6d9df7ca403b6f0c9af39b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b-a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/b/62bdadf8cf9891bb42812ef0d8ebdfa6cc7feb9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"39\" height=\"14\" /> are same parity and  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/9/1a983c0c4e690d22461d86a1c0cfc1d48e6448d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4p\\cdot m \\cdot n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"17\" /> is even integer. So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/c/02c60c151331e235dc6d9df7ca403b6f0c9af39b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b-a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/b/62bdadf8cf9891bb42812ef0d8ebdfa6cc7feb9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"39\" height=\"14\" /> are both even integers. Therefore,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/4/654a611556da626d3e03a7f34bfe4a616db2b079.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{rcr} b+a =  &amp; 2pn \\\\ b-a =  &amp; 2m  \\end{array} \\right.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"138\" height=\"45\" />\nor \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/5/b75dbdce780dedbd439152266dd10a08c05f422f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{rcr} b+a =  &amp; 2pm \\\\ b-a =  &amp; 2n  \\end{array} \\right.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"143\" height=\"45\" />\nTherefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa24ad22e84abb2c976566ed741db8d91db1705c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=pn - m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"16\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/6/9c670207f8d4c1ec7e2ff2a7caa420e9c24a2676.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = pm - n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"16\" />. For each case, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/f/86f259ed96614dbfa9deb6b56a5bf5c2ca9dd5b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p-q = p - 4mn - 1 &lt; a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"199\" height=\"17\" />. But <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/d/62d8426d6fa86e95d41a35d99b3ef48155c3cf87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p-q = a^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"83\" height=\"20\" />, this gives a contradiction. No solution for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/9/d39edf0ac0842fc2112763703303888b36465c98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q = 4k + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p><p><br />\nWe conclude that the only solution is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/b/59b4df1881f7da3b0308c1784e3fed60541c8134.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(p,q) = (3,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"107\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>(Lokman GÖKÇE)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We claim that the only solution is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/b/59b4df1881f7da3b0308c1784e3fed60541c8134.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(p,q) = (3,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"107\" height=\"20\" />. First, this clearly works, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/b/2cb427e4a6689432965fc69513f23f080b484969.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-2=1^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"83\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/c/17c453fa456c94f4d44c46dcdc0fbe3519fbeb4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\cdot2-2=2^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Start as in Solution 2 - assign positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/4/5f4bf5eb49eb976370c998db03e26d528d21dd3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m, n,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"39\" height=\"11\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/c/b1c07791658a8984d45e7a6b049e5805cdd64516.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p-q=m^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/a/d3aee8fe67df62deb14fb7227f23220575a0b5fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$pq-q=n^2.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"98\" height=\"20\" /> Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/1/4f153dda0ff95a4e75b1cab432b9325b47daa5c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$pq-p=n^2-m^2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"144\" height=\"20\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/7/2476a78c96d62bf0de4b3c1587e3968347ce8cac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(q-1)=(n-m)(n+m).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"221\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>First, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/a/90ab389d117f5acfe55e1f4be7a86e64cbdc26f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"11\" /> is impossible, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/1/101b2c0adff482d62ebe9cfb2e7a79f2623d0c8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p^2-p = p(p-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"138\" height=\"21\" /> is not a perfect square. Now notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/c/e8c1991fdc6403e4d7ad09ab72269a0e6fe5e7ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m&lt;p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/3/8b38c990931c6788d4b3769ea92737732efa45c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n&lt;\\max(p,q-1).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"147\" height=\"20\" /> But <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/3/3c3790589171e8b53c3379e19347991077c20b7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p-q&gt;0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"17\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/8/dc87d9fa15926e9d6ce78755a60e7ebbaa504de6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p\\geq q-1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"17\" /> Now, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/1/0919037931abf691c6ff3e714bde2bd809faaf00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m, n &lt; p.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/a/13a08868b0a1023cd389ac62a3a4084cd99dcec4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-m$\" width=\"48\" height=\"8\" /> can't ever be a factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/6/9c699725218958e044a4f271042b0b40b9ed713f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"14\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/3/fb3fb4e804df16fc25d3134f9b9c9ba55ca4bd0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+m&lt;2p,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"98\" height=\"17\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/2/9c24d0285cdfe3daaa67d550b992641e86295f15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+m=p.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"89\" height=\"16\" /> Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/b/ccbf4b63e1df22ed19a2a5f7a9bc8740b5c064c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-m=q-1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"120\" height=\"17\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/c/69c54f018b6eb2da6fe9f7a1063cae7281311ec8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p-q=2m-1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"128\" height=\"17\" /> But <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/4/0e403c1ab5d844d0cf40f94eb84e6a554bf54779.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p-q=m^2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"20\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/9/72971ed1b74454d4fa0b30e4083f4845be6b1001.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m^2=2m-1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"111\" height=\"20\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/0/970185763e4e9ae803e02462b6122a0c8f47d5f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" /> Therefore, one of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> (and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is not a prime).\n</p><p>Thus, we conclude that our claim is true.\n</p><p>(grape1984)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:40%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_USAMO\" title=\"2022 USAMO\">2022 USAMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_USAMO_Problems\" title=\"2022 USAMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=27&amp;year=2022\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2022 USAMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2022 USAMO Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2022 USAMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2022 USAMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2022 USAMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2022 USAMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_USAMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2022 USAMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=USAMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"USAMO Problems and Solutions\"> All USAMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018022347\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.071 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 584/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1313/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 48/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 19444/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.418      1 -total\n 61.57%    8.262      1 Template:USAMO_newbox\n 36.15%    4.850      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:22639:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018022347 and revision id 254772. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}